          "doc_id": "META-FY2025",
          "heading_path": [
            "Item 8 Financial Statements and Supplementary Data",
            "Legal and Related Matters",
            "Privacy and Related Matters"
          ],
          "item": "8",
          "text": "On January 19, 2022, we filed a motion to dismiss, which was denied in part on May 10, 2023. The insider trading claim was dismissed as to all defendants except Mark Zuckerberg, and the motion was denied as to the breach of fiduciary duty claims. Trial began on July 16, 2025. On July 17, 2025, the parties agreed to a settlement in principle to resolve all claims in the action, which is subject to court approval."
        },
        "doc": {
          "aliases": ["Meta", "Facebook"],
